  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chef Viktor is at the hospital after being hit by a car. The doctor examines his leg, but Viktor makes up a story to protect the person who hit him.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "У вас надрыв связок.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "Это не очень страшно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "Не нагружайте ногу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Спасибо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "Какая причина вашей травмы?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я попал под машину.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "Будете заявлять в полицию?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я забыл поставить машину на ручник.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "И она на меня наехала.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "Понятно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Заявлять не буду.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's listen to their conversation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "У вас надрыв связок.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have a partial ligament tear.' After examining Viktor's leg at the hospital, the doctor diagnoses a partial ligament tear.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "Это не очень страшно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's not too serious.' He reassures the chef that the injury is not too serious.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "Не нагружайте ногу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Keep your weight off that leg.' Still, the doctor warns Viktor to keep his weight off that leg while it heals.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Спасибо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you.' Barinov thanks the doctor for the exam.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "Какая причина вашей травмы?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is the cause of your injury?' Filling out his report, the doctor asks how the injury happened. Chef Viktor answers straight away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я попал под машину.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I got hit by a car.' Viktor admits that he got hit by a car.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "Будете заявлять в полицию?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Will you report to the police?' the speaker puts 'will be' up front so the listener immediately catches the tone, followed by 'declare'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No.' When asked if he will file a police report against the driver, Viktor says no.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я забыл поставить машину на ручник.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I forgot to put the car on handbrake.' To protect Elena from losing her license, Viktor makes up a story about forgetting his own handbrake.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "И она на меня наехала.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And it ran over me.' He claims his own parked car rolled forward and bumped into him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "Понятно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I see.' The doctor nods and takes down the excuse without pressing further. And Chef Viktor jumps in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Заявлять не буду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will not report it.' Viktor repeats firmly that he will not be reporting the accident. Now let's hear the whole thing once more.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "doctor",
      "t": "У вас надрыв связок.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
